{"id":"658599319","kind":"article","title":"泄压阀","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Stress_valve"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"睡眠研究 & 生活建议","date":"2023-09-28","updated":"2023-09-28","votes":46,"comment_count":6,"minutes":1,"chars":578,"keywords":["急性压力","慢性压力","睡眠","生物钟","压力管理"],"summary":"本条目把“泄压阀”定义为减轻急性压力的活动，强调其使用时机应配合生物钟，时机不当的运动或午睡可能反而干扰睡眠。条目列举运动、午睡、自由睡眠等方式，并提出泄压阀或能帮助缓解慢性压力；脑细胞凋亡的解释被标为假设。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/658599319","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"Wl2cwKAa\"><b>泄压阀</b>是指能够减轻或消除急性压力的活动。例如，在恰当时间进行的锻炼是一种<b>泄压阀</b>，它有助于启用最佳的<b>泄压阀</b>：自由而健康的夜间睡眠。</p><p data-pid=\"6HDkZTTv\"><b>泄压阀</b>是防止<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Acute_stress\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">急性压力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>演变为即使在夜间睡眠之后仍然存在的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Chronic_stress\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">慢性压力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>的最佳工具。</p><p data-pid=\"2vmeLmIp\"><b>泄压阀</b>必须在合适的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian_time\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生物钟时间</a>使用。例如，时机不当的锻炼可能会损害夜间睡眠质量，产生适得其反的效果。不当时机的午睡可能会破坏睡眠周期，加剧压力问题（参见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Best_time_for_napping\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最佳午睡时间</a>）。</p><p data-pid=\"hX71Ey1x\">有助于缓解<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Acute_stress\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">急性压力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>的重要<b>泄压阀</b>包括：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"5BBnKM4I\"> 更多的急性压力（引起急性压力耗竭）<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"V_xhiqDR\"> 筋疲力竭的锻炼<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"EWByJYcS\"> 疼痛（比如，暴露在寒冷的环境中）<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"i-_JaZKO\"> 午睡<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"GV50kZQZ\"> 高效产出（学习、创造力、解决问题等）<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"ibcR6iXL\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Free_running_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自由</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>的夜间睡眠<br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"nVxwGE-l\">即使<b>泄压阀</b>最终效果不佳，从长期来看，它们仍然有助于减轻<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Chronic_stress\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">慢性压力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。对抗慢性压力的一种假设性防御措施是与慢性压力记忆相关的脑细胞凋亡。从这个意义上讲，可能<b>泄压阀</b>在预防脑细胞凋亡方面起到了作用。</p><p data-pid=\"NRFXfj06\"><b>泄压阀有助于改善心理健康</b></p><p data-pid=\"erSl39gQ\">参见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Using_stress_valves_to_prevent_chronic_stress\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">利用泄压阀来预防慢性压力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup></p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"9TrEMXUJ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Stress_valve\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Stress valve - supermemo.guru</a><br/>本<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Glossary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">术语表</a>条目用于解释 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo_Guru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo Guru</a> 系列中关于记忆、学习、创造力和问题解决的文本。</blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 急性压力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"523345805\" href=\"#/post/523345805\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 慢性压力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"426177682\" href=\"#/post/426177682\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 优质睡眠公式 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"497982873\" href=\"#/post/497982873\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 利用泄压阀来预防慢性压力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"658388235\" href=\"#/post/658388235\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"658388235","title":"利用泄压阀来预防慢性压力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":102,"minutes":11,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 睡眠研究 & 生活建议"},{"id":"662753699","title":"优化成长过程中的行为空间","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":35,"minutes":34,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 睡眠研究 & 生活建议"},{"id":"497982873","title":"6 优质睡眠公式","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":82,"minutes":12,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"523345805","title":"急性压力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":28,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"426177682","title":"慢性压力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":58,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"670118024","title":"斯坦福教授 Huberman：如何应对压力与焦虑 ep.10","author":"Andrew Huberman","votes":165,"minutes":15,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「慢性压力」· Andrew Huberman"},{"id":"542877157","title":"压力导致的“学习加速”","author":"B L Callaghan","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「慢性压力」· B L Callaghan"},{"id":"24426750334","title":"「再努力点」在某些情况下可能是个糟糕的策略","author":"Sasha Chapin","votes":65,"minutes":2,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Sasha Chapin"},{"id":"2019711251832387575","title":"别做那么多想当然的假设","author":"Jose Luis Ricon","votes":116,"minutes":9,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Jose Luis Ricon"},{"id":"1907070944251446637","title":"坚韧","author":"Georgios Zonnios","votes":101,"minutes":1,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Georgios Zonnios"}],"rec_answers":[]}